---
// Política de privacidade em inglês — adaptação da versão PT, generalizada
// para público internacional (sem citar LGPD/ANPD especificamente).
import { SITE } from '../../../consts';

const title = 'Privacy Policy | Resolve Simples';
const description = 'How Resolve Simples collects, uses, shares and protects your personal data.';
const canonical = new URL('/en/privacy-policy/', SITE.url).toString();
const ptAlternate = new URL('/politica-de-privacidade/', SITE.url).toString();
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>{title}</title>
<meta name="description" content={description} />
<link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
<link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href={canonical} />
<link rel="alternate" hreflang="pt-BR" href={ptAlternate} />
<link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href={ptAlternate} />
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
<meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style is:global set:html={`
:root{
    --ink:#0D1B2A; --ink-soft:#2B3B4A; --ink-faint:#5A6B7C;
    --paper:#F2F4F7; --paper-raised:#FFFFFF; --line:#DDE3EA;
    --teal:#00A78E; --blue:#1565C0; --radius:14px; --maxw:680px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{
    background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);
    font-family:"Poppins",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
    font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;padding:0 20px 80px;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto}

  .masthead{padding:26px 0 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}
  .mark{width:9px;height:9px;background:var(--teal);border-radius:2px;transform:rotate(45deg)}
  .brand{font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);text-decoration:none}

  header.hero{padding:42px 0 8px}
  h1{font-family:"Poppins",sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(30px,7.5vw,44px);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin-bottom:14px}
  .deck{font-size:17.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);max-width:34em}
  .atualizado{
    font-family:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;
    color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:18px;
  }

  .aviso{
    background:var(--paper-raised);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:4px solid var(--teal);
    border-radius:0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;padding:20px 20px;margin:28px 0 8px;
  }
  .aviso p{font-size:15.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:0}

  h2{
    font-family:"Poppins",sans-serif;font-weight:700;
    font-size:clamp(21px,5.2vw,26px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.02em;
    margin:44px 0 12px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  h3{font-family:"Poppins",sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;margin:24px 0 8px}
  p{margin-bottom:15px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}

  ul{list-style:none;margin:0 0 18px;padding:0}
  li{position:relative;padding-left:24px;margin-bottom:9px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:3px;top:11px;width:7px;height:7px;background:var(--teal);border-radius:2px}

  table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:6px 0 20px;font-size:15.5px}
  th,td{text-align:left;padding:11px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}
  th{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);font-size:14px}
  td{color:var(--ink-soft)}

  a{color:var(--blue)}

  footer{margin-top:44px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-faint)}
`}></style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <header class="masthead">
    <div class="mark" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <a class="brand" href="/en/">VAGA Protocol</a>
  </header>

  <header class="hero">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="deck">This page explains what data Resolve Simples collects, what we use it for, who we share it with, and how you can ask to see, correct or delete it.</p>
    <p class="atualizado">Last updated: 2026-08-11</p>
  </header>

  <div class="aviso">
    <p>We write this in plain language on purpose. If any part isn't clear, write to <a href="mailto:contato@resolvesimples.com.br">contato@resolvesimples.com.br</a> and we'll answer.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>1. Who is responsible for your data</h2>
  <p>The controller of the data processed on this site is Felipe Arrais Serodio, an individual sole proprietor based in Brazil, responsible for the resolvesimples.com.br / resolvesimples.com websites.</p>
  <p>Contact for privacy matters: <a href="mailto:contato@resolvesimples.com.br">contato@resolvesimples.com.br</a>.</p>

  <h2>2. What data we collect</h2>

  <h3>Data you give us</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Business figures you enter in the calculator</strong>: average ticket per appointment, appointments booked, cancellations and no-shows, slots recovered, average duration.</li>
    <li><strong>The content of messages</strong> you send us by email.</li>
    <li><strong>Name and email</strong>, if and when a contact form or newsletter sign-up is offered on a given page.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Calculator figures are only processed in your browser to show you the result — they are not stored on our servers unless you separately submit them through a form.</p>

  <h3>Data collected automatically</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Browsing data</strong>: IP address, browser and device type, pages visited, time on site, and where you came from (including campaign parameters like <em>utm_source</em>).</li>
    <li><strong>Cookies and similar technologies</strong>, as described in section 6.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. What we use it for, and on what basis</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Purpose</th><th>Basis</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Respond to messages you send us</td><td>Carrying out your request</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Process the purchase of digital products and grant access to them</td><td>Performance of a contract</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Understand how the site is used and improve it</td><td>Legitimate interest</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Comply with legal, tax and regulatory obligations</td><td>Legal obligation</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>4. Who we share data with</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your data and we do not hand it to third parties to use for their own marketing. We share only with providers necessary to operate the site:</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Who</th><th>What for</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Brevo</td><td>Store contact records and send email, where an email flow is active</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Kiwify</td><td>Process payments and deliver purchased digital products</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Google (Analytics)</td><td>Measure site traffic</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Our hosting provider</td><td>Keep the site online</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>We may also share data when required by law or by a valid request from a competent authority.</p>
  <p>Some of these providers operate servers outside your country. In those cases, the transfer takes place under the safeguards applicable to that provider and, where relevant, under Brazil's data protection law (LGPD), since the site is operated from Brazil.</p>

  <h2>5. Cookies, ads and affiliate links</h2>
  <p>Cookies are small files the site stores in your browser. We use:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Necessary cookies</strong>, for the site to function.</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics cookies</strong>, to know how many people visit each page and where from.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings.</p>
  <p><strong>Affiliate links.</strong> Some pages on the Brazilian version of this site contain links through which we may earn a commission if you buy the product referred. This does not change the price you pay. The English-language pages are our own product only, with no third-party affiliate links.</p>

  <h2>6. How long we keep it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Purchase records</strong>: for as long as required by applicable tax and civil law.</li>
    <li><strong>Browsing data</strong>: for the retention period set by the analytics tools we use.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live, laws such as the GDPR (EU/UK), the CCPA (California) or Brazil's LGPD may give you the right to, at any time:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Confirm whether we process your data and get access to it</li>
    <li>Correct incomplete, outdated or incorrect data</li>
    <li>Request deletion of data processed on the basis of your consent</li>
    <li>Request portability of your data to another provider</li>
    <li>Know who we share your data with</li>
    <li>Withdraw consent and be informed of the consequences</li>
    <li>Object to processing you consider improper</li>
  </ul>
  <p>To exercise any of these rights, write to <a href="mailto:contato@resolvesimples.com.br">contato@resolvesimples.com.br</a>. We respond within a reasonable time, generally under 30 days. We may ask for additional information solely to confirm it's really you making the request.</p>

  <h2>8. Security</h2>
  <p>We take reasonable measures to protect the data we're responsible for, including restricted access and providers that offer adequate protection. No system is fully immune, which is why we only keep the data necessary for the purposes described here.</p>
  <p>In the event of a security incident with meaningful risk, we will notify affected users and, where legally required, the competent data protection authority.</p>

  <h2>9. Children</h2>
  <p>This site is directed at business owners and professionals. We do not knowingly collect data from anyone under 18. If we identify such a record, it will be removed.</p>

  <h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this text to reflect changes to the site or to applicable law. The date at the top of the page shows the latest version. Material changes are communicated by email to anyone subscribed.</p>

  <footer>
    <p>Resolve Simples &middot; <a href="/en/">resolvesimples.com</a><br>
    Felipe Arrais Serodio &middot; <a href="mailto:contato@resolvesimples.com.br">contato@resolvesimples.com.br</a></p>
  </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
